# Replica Set (`white-replica.yaml`)
Used to maintain the **desired state (number of pods)** and reduce downtime.

```yaml
apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: ReplicaSet
metadata:
  name: blue-replica1
  namespace: white-2
spec:
  replicas: 5
  selector:
    matchLabels:
      app: ipl
  template:
    metadata:
      labels:
        app: ipl
    spec:
      containers:
        - name: c-2
          image: daviddocker526/ipl
          ports:
            - containerPort: 80
```
```bash
kubectl apply -f white-replica.yaml
kubectl get rs -n white-2
kubectl get pods -n white-2
```

